  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, tu tombes bien ! On est en train de tourner\nle dernier film de ma trilogie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux tourner une scène où un Pokémon\npréhistorique saccage une ville à notre époque.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour l’occasion, j’avais pensé au roi du monde\npréhistorique : Rexillius !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais j’ai pas le budget pour restaurer un fossile\nmoi-même !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006A20190061006900200070006100730020006C0065002000620075006400670065007400200070006F00750072002000720065007300740061007500720065007200200075006E00200066006F007300730069006C0065000A006D006F0069002D006D00EA006D00650020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pourquoi j’attendais ta visite !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200070006F0075007200710075006F00690020006A20190061007400740065006E006400610069007300200074006100200076006900730069007400650020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce que t’aurais restauré un fossile pour\nle faire évoluer en Rexillius, par hasard ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi oui, tu veux bien me laisser le filmer ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si t’acceptes, j’aurai aussi un petit rôle\nà te confier, cette fois !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006900200074201900610063006300650070007400650073002C0020006A20190061007500720061006900200061007500730073006900200075006E0020007000650074006900740020007200F4006C0065000A00E000200074006500200063006F006E0066006900650072002C00200063006500740074006500200066006F006900730020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu veux bien me laisser filmer ton Rexillius,\najoute-le à ton équipe, s’il te plaît !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si y a pas l’budget, y a pas l’budget...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069002000790020006100200070006100730020006C2019006200750064006700650074002C002000790020006100200070006100730020006C2019006200750064006700650074002E002E002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai jamais vu de Pokémon préhistorique...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E2019006100690020006A0061006D00610069007300200076007500200064006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200070007200E90068006900730074006F00720069007100750065002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Incroyaaable ! Un Rexillius en chair et en os !!!\nTu veux bien que je le filme, alors ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB0072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas vraiment...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200076007200610069006D0065006E0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... Bon, ben... j’ai plus qu’à investir dans\nun costume. J’espère qu’ils ont ma taille...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je savais que je pouvais compter sur toi !\nJe vais faire de vous deux des stars !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, on reprend le tournage !\nPrêts... Action !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020006F006E002000720065007000720065006E00640020006C006500200074006F00750072006E00610067006500200021000A0050007200EA00740073002E002E002E00200041006300740069006F006E0020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, regardez, là-bas ! C’est terrible !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200072006500670061007200640065007A002C0020006C00E0002D006200610073002000210020004320190065007300740020007400650072007200690062006C00650020002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Groaaaaaar !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006F0061006100610061006100610072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que... ?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D006300650020007100750065002E002E002E0020003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "U-un monstre ?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055002D0075006E0020006D006F006E00730074007200650020003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh non ! Il fonce droit sur nous !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006E006F006E0020002100200049006C00200066006F006E00630065002000640072006F0069007400200073007500720020006E006F00750073002000210021002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Agrougrouuuh ! ♥",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100670072006F007500670072006F007500750075006800200021002026650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Coupez !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F007500700065007A002000210021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est quoi ce cri, un numéro de charme ?\nJe veux de la terreur, pas du choupi !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh, à ce sujet...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIls en ont pas l’air, mais les Rexillius peuvent\napparemment apprendre la capacité Charme...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et faut croire que leur tempérament violent\ns’estompe face à leur Dresseur ou Dresseuse...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi ?! Donc il peut pas tourner avec\ns<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĂona Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse sans lui faire les yeux doux ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoique... un Pokémon préhistorique\nqui s’attache aux êtres humains...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois qu’on tient quelque chose !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F006900730020007100752019006F006E0020007400690065006E00740020007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F007300650020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous êtes sûr ? J’ai l’impression qu’on a changé\nla totalité de nos scripts, là...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et c’est très bien comme ça !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200063201900650073007400200074007200E800730020006200690065006E00200063006F006D006D0065002000E700610020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pensais que les Pokémon terrifiants étaient un\nbon thème pour cette trilogie... mais que nenni !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’harmonie entre êtres humains et Pokémon,\nça, c’est un angle bien plus intéressant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et tout ce qu’on a filmé jusqu’à présent\ncorrespond parfaitement à ce merveilleux thème !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça dépeint bien mieux la réalité d’Illumis que\nmon idée initiale, qui baignait dans les clichés !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes films vont cartonner, c’est sûr !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650073002000660069006C006D007300200076006F006E007400200063006100720074006F006E006E00650072002C0020006320190065007300740020007300FB00720020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci à toi et à tes Pokémon de m’avoir\nsi bien inspiré !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002000E000200074006F0069002000650074002000E0002000740065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006400650020006D201900610076006F00690072000A007300690020006200690065006E00200069006E007300700069007200E90020002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une trilogie qui dépeint l’harmonie entre êtres\nhumains et Pokémon... ça va cartonner, c’est sûr !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai accepté ce rôle pour l’argent, mais c’est pas\ncette trilogie qui va faire décoller ma carrière...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Pokémon sont vraiment plus adorables\nles uns que les autres ! Rexillius aussi, bien sûr !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    }
  ],
